		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=22121#p22121"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>LOG:&#160; database system was interrupted; last known up at 2015-06-29 00:14:07 CEST<br />LOG:&#160; database system was not properly shut down; automatic recovery in progress<br />LOG:&#160; consistent recovery state reached at A9/D6D01F98<br />LOG:&#160; redo starts at A9/D6D01F98<br />LOG:&#160; record with zero length at A9/D6D29160<br />LOG:&#160; redo done at A9/D6D29120<br />LOG:&#160; last completed transaction was at log time 2015-06-29 00:44:42.586+02</p><p>Et là ça reste bloqué.<br />J&#039;ai ce processus :<br />postgres: startup process&#160; &#160;recovering 00000001000000A9000000D6<br />mais rien ne se passe.</p>]]></content>
